---
import EnglishSiteLayout from "../../layouts/EnglishSiteLayout.astro";
---
<EnglishSiteLayout
  title="Support Canapalandia | Independent editorial work"
  description="Support Canapalandia's independent editorial work on hemp, CBD, cannabis, research and regulation."
  canonical="/en/support/"
  alternateIt="/sostieni-la-nostra-causa/"
>
  <article class="en-page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
      <h1>Help keep independent information available.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Canapalandia publishes free reporting, explainers and tools. Reader support helps cover the time and infrastructure needed to research, update and maintain the project.</p>
    </header>
    <section>
      <h2>Why support the project</h2>
      <p>Maintaining an independent archive means checking sources, revisiting older articles, following regulatory changes and keeping the website and free tools online.</p>
      <p>Support is voluntary and does not give donors influence over editorial conclusions.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
      <p>You can share useful articles, report errors, suggest official sources or follow Canapalandia on its social channels. These actions also help the project reach readers who are looking for reliable context.</p>
      <p><a href="/en/contact/">Contact the editorial team →</a></p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Donations</h2>
      <p>The current Italian support page contains the active donation options and payment information. Until the payment interface itself is localized, use that page to complete a contribution.</p>
      <p><a class="cta" href="/sostieni-la-nostra-causa/" lang="it">Open the current support page →</a></p>
    </section>
  </article>
</EnglishSiteLayout>
<style>
  .en-page{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 0 5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--brand);font:700 .78rem/1.2 Archivo,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.en-page h1{margin:.35rem 0 1rem;font:500 clamp(3rem,7vw,5.6rem)/.95 Newsreader,serif}.lead{font-size:1.14rem}.en-page section{margin-top:2.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:1.2rem}.en-page h2{font:500 1.9rem/1.1 Newsreader,serif}.en-page p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.en-page a{color:var(--brand);font-weight:700}.cta{display:inline-block;padding:.75rem .9rem;border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;text-decoration:none}
</style>
